    "regime_notes": "Daily IC and ICIR remain positive in 2020-22 (0.03678/0.11036), 2023-25 (0.03241/0.10014), and 2026-30 (0.04154/0.12419). The 15-asset cross-section and 1,660 observations support conservative interpretation. Negative multi-day decay confirms use as a one-day overlay only."
